'''Mary Elizabeth Winstead''', born [[November 28]], [[1984]], is an [[Wikipedia:Americans|American]] [[Wikipedia:Actor|actress]]<ref name="Rotten" /> who portrays [[Hera Syndulla]] in the [[2023]] television series ''[[Star Wars: Ahsoka]]''.<ref name="YouTube">{{SWYouTube|HKzMPVVa50A|Rosario Dawson, Natasha Liu Bordizzo and Mary Elizabeth Winstead &#124; Star Wars Celebration LIVE! 2023}}</ref> She is known for roles such as [https://scottpilgrim.fandom.com/wiki/Ramona_Flowers Ramona Flowers] in ''[[Wikipedia:Scott Pilgrim vs. the World|Scott Pilgrim vs. the World]]'' and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scott_Pilgrim_Takes_Off ''Scott Pilgrim Takes Off''], Gwen Grayson in ''[[Wikipedia:Sky High (2005 film)|Sky High]]'', [[w:c:finaldestination:Wendy Christensen|Wendy Christensen]] in ''[[Wikipedia:Final Destination 3|Final Destination 3]]'', and the [[w:c:dcextendeduniverse:Huntress|Huntress]] in ''[[Wikipedia:Birds of Prey (2020 film)|Birds of Prey]]''.<ref name="Rotten">{{WebCite|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/celebrity/1167982-mary_elizabeth_winstead|text=Mary Elizabeth Winstead|work=[[Wikipedia:Rotten Tomatoes|Rotten Tomatoes]]|archivedate=20230414211830}}</ref> Winstead is the wife and stepmother of fellow ''[[Star Wars]]'' actors [[Ewan McGregor]] and [[Esther-Rose McGregor]], respectively.<ref name="Metro">{{WebCite|url=https://metro.co.uk/2022/06/09/obi-wan-kenobi-ewan-mcgregors-daughter-didnt-get-role-through-him-16797256|text=Ewan McGregor insists daughter wasn't cast in Obi-Wan Kenobi because of him: 'She auditioned for the role'|author=Barr, Sabrina|date=2022-06-09|work=''[[Wikipedia:Metro (British newspaper)|Metro]]''|quote=Ewan McGregor has opened up about how his daughter Esther-Rose McGregor bagged a part in his Star Wars series Obi-Wan Kenobi, revealing that she auditioned on her own accord. (...) Ewan was married to Esther's mother, production designer Eve Mavrakis from 1995 until 2020, when their divorce was finalised. The former couple share four daughters together, two of whom were adopted. Esther, who was born in November 2001, is 20 years old. The Obi-Wan actor married Scott Pilgrim vs The World star Mary Elizabeth Winstead this year, having welcomed their son Laurie in June 2021.|archivedate=20230416174500}}</ref>

